# The root .gitignore excludes *.jsonl, which is right for this repository - traces,
# generated dialogues and cached datasets all end in .jsonl and none of them belong in
# git. The small run-input artifacts here are the exception, tracked deliberately.
#
# They are run inputs rather than raw data: NPZ files are fitted rewards, and JSONL
# files are tutoring moments the policy answers. The eduLLM platform builds its
# container image from a git checkout, so an
# artifact that is not committed is an artifact the run on AWS cannot see.
#
# The negation lives here rather than in the root file so that the reason travels with
# the exception, and so the root stays as upstream wrote it.
!*.jsonl
